Hello.
I am looking for some time at this mailing list and found exactly the
problem I have with my motherboard ASUS N4L-VM DM ( C2D Merom + ALC882
). Originally it was reported by Nicolas Di Pietro [potens@swing.be] for
Asus P5WD motherboard. As it is taken care by Tobin Davis I am asking to
add this motherboard to the list and am going to report results.
Regards,
Oleg Aleksandrov

> Sent: Samstag, 23. Dezember 2006 05:08
