> The card is an integrated on an Asus P5WD.
> There are 6 jack on the card plus 1 spdif coax, 1 spdif optical and 1
connexion on the motherboard for mic and line out > for the case front
(can be used in hda mode or legacy AC97 mode). There is also something
special, a connector for using > the speakers the the computer is off.

Same config for Asus N4L-VM DH.

The simptoms are the same:
-no master control,
-digital out randomly locks ( most of the time is locked ),
-similar behavior is observered for ALSA 1.0.13 and 1.0.14rc1.

